{"path":"ranges/split_view/base","title":"std::ranges::split_view<V,Pattern>::base","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::split_view&lt;V,Pattern&gt;::</span>base","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/split_view/base","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a copy of the underlying view base_.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> V base<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> requires <a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/copy_constructible\"><span class=\"kw2967\">std::<span class=\"me2\">copy_constructible</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> V base<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a copy of the underlying view <code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/split_view#base\">base_</a></i></code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Copy constructs the result from the underlying view.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Move constructs the result from the underlying view.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> A copy of the underlying view.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> A